<section class="section container faq-section-wrapper">
    <img src="/images/faqs-image_1.png"
         alt="Gym member lifting a barbell" />
    <div class="faq-wrapper">
        <h2 class="badge">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <h3 class="section-heading">
            Common questions about gym and training
        </h3>

        <details>
            <summary>
                Q1. Do I need prior gym experience to Join
                CoreFitness?
                <span class="round-icon">
                    <partial name="Partials/Icons/_ChevronDown" />
                </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="details-content">
                <p>
                    No, GymPro is designed for all fitness
                    levels. Our trainers guide beginners with
                    proper techniques and structured workout
                    plans to help them start safely and
                    confidently.
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Every new member receives a personalized
                        introduction to equipments
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Workouts are designed to grow with you,
                        ensuring beginners can start safely.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>
                Q2. What facilities are included with the
                membership?
                <span class="round-icon">
                    <partial name="Partials/Icons/_ChevronDown" />
                </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="details-content">
                <p>
                    Yes, your membership gives you access to a
                    wide range of training facilities and
                    equipment.
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Fully equipped gym with both cardio and
                        strength training machines.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Free weights and functional training
                        areas.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Changing rooms with showers and lockers.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>
                Q3. Can I try them gym before taking a
                membership?
                <span class="round-icon">
                    <partial name="Partials/Icons/_ChevronDown" />
                </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="details-content">
                <p>
                    Yes, we offer the opportunity to try the gym
                    before making a decision.
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Free or discounted trial sessions for
                        new visitors.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Opportunity to meet trainers and explore
                        the facilities.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Guidance in choosing the right
                        membership after your trial.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>
                Q4. Are there group workout programs available?
                <span class="round-icon">
                    <partial name="Partials/Icons/_ChevronDown" />
                </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="details-content">
                <p>
                    Yes, we offer a variety of group workout
                    classes for all fitness levels.
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Classes such as yoga, HIIT, spinning,
                        and strength training.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Led by certified and experienced
                        instructors.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Regularly updated schedule to keep
                        workouts varied and motivating.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>
                Q5. Is nutrition guidance included in the plans?
                <span class="round-icon">
                    <partial name="Partials/Icons/_ChevronDown" />
                </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="details-content">
                <p>
                    Yes, we provide basic nutrition guidance as
                    part of your fitness journey.
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        General guidelines for a healthy diet
                        and lifestyle.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Option for personalized coaching at an
                        additional cost.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Tailored recommendations to support your
                        fitness goals.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </details>
    </div>
</section>
